      "id": "answer-common-main-boundary",
      "questionId": "question-common-main-boundary",
      "shortAnswer": "commonMain is compiled for applicable targets and cannot assume Android-only APIs.",
      "completeAnswer": "commonMain is a shared Source Set whose code participates in the applicable target Compilations. Because it must remain valid for those targets, it cannot directly depend on Android-only APIs such as android.util.Log; platform-specific behavior belongs in the platform Source Set or behind an expect/actual boundary.",
